# Node simulator (fake windows)
#
# Each sim drives the tiler against fake windows and asserts on the geometry it writes: no session,
# compositor or display needed.
#
# The whole suite, plus the QML passes and the lints:
#   tools/test.sh
#
# One sim, from the repository root:
#   node src/comp/tests/sim13.mjs src/comp/script/contents/code/kosmic-tiling.mjs keybindings.json
#
# The first argument is the tiler; sims that check the keymap take keybindings.json as the second.
# Sims that touch the layout core resolve core.mjs as a sibling of the tiler, so pass the file in its
# own directory, not a copy extracted on its own.
#
# tools/test.sh globs this directory, but CI only sees committed files: `git add` a new sim before
# believing a green run.
#
# A new sim has to fail against the behaviour it pins down: break the branch on purpose and watch the
# assertion fire before trusting it.
